{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/B7NWu2IWAIPuuZU1lW5zcg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:30.480346+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/B7NWu2IWAIPuuZU1lW5zcg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVjlicWv1tc7bcSuPXYhQiaryZSBLle3BZktwEdCH8hliaAY9FAnwKww8sw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVU7Snmrrf523zPYsgrBBkUmYwDzulj7riaOzKhWibZUict8kQSXSUIqiajg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVWJgfAjAbPUSbpomLbdqlQIOrfJyNHlwPIG0a9lvNeAyhgsZHAraKLw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVNbSrgEibXBBd6cuGqw4KJHXuMZ0ZJzT91Kshd1a4k5Nzc6qfUM1NLkA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JV0KfxPx1RJv9dwC5qHA18wPpMHnZiaQxCUGZrRprBVnwRLuOqDc8eWww/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVib99WZZpicrm5o002MYG8dmILLC0BlJCpF6aZNIyMpniaEyErO0x4H2pQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVtqH4z3pKAga5t5nkTM1F2GgLZ0s44NRvmlNngYibF1FYHtJyCjia7vOg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVTRQZpXf83N5ibwyNGzU0EhV1j5Eye4waLUIILMUia9uCEw8yAtWy1ibZw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>“电子信息之星”</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>优秀大学生夏令营</span></b></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>华东师范大学物理与电子科学学院电子科学系拥有电子科学与技术一级学科学位点，涵盖类脑智能材料与器件、半导体材料计算与器件仿真、智能电子与光电子技术、微纳电子技术等多个研究方向。电子科学系依托极化材料与器件教育部重点实验室开展科学研究和人才培养工作，现面向全国高等院校大学生招收2025年“电子信息之星”夏令营营员。本次夏令营旨在帮助优秀大学生深入了解电子科学与技术的前沿研究动态、关键核心技术突破与未来产业前景，以及本系在该领域发展和人才培养的优势和特色，并激发科研探索热情，拓展学术视野，提升面向国家重大战略需求和新一代信息技术发展的创新潜力与科学素养。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVxS9ia1BqSG2avnDtQeiaBU7vlQ3QibalV9UibSziarcmJbScpSOEsmfelFg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生对象</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVxS9ia1BqSG2avnDtQeiaBU7vlQ3QibalV9UibSziarcmJbScpSOEsmfelFg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>电子科学系“电子信息之星”面向全国高等院校（含本校）有志攻读研究生的<span>2022级（拟2026年夏毕业）优秀在校本科生</span>。申请者所学专业包括但不限于电子、物理或材料相关专业背景。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVxS9ia1BqSG2avnDtQeiaBU7vlQ3QibalV9UibSziarcmJbScpSOEsmfelFg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVxS9ia1BqSG2avnDtQeiaBU7vlQ3QibalV9UibSziarcmJbScpSOEsmfelFg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>1、拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></p><p><span>2、学习成绩优秀，能够获得所在学校推荐免试资格者优先； </span></p><p><span>3、具有扎实的学科背景，有志于从事电子科学与技术研究工作，具有较强的研究、创新能力潜力；</span></p><p><span>4、英语水平好，具有较强的英语写作和口语表达能力。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVxS9ia1BqSG2avnDtQeiaBU7vlQ3QibalV9UibSziarcmJbScpSOEsmfelFg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>举办形式和时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVxS9ia1BqSG2avnDtQeiaBU7vlQ3QibalV9UibSziarcmJbScpSOEsmfelFg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>本次夏令营采用线上形式进行，时间拟定于7月10日-11日。将开展的活动主要有学科介绍、实验室介绍、课题组介绍、师生交流等，具体日程另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVxS9ia1BqSG2avnDtQeiaBU7vlQ3QibalV9UibSziarcmJbScpSOEsmfelFg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名及申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVxS9ia1BqSG2avnDtQeiaBU7vlQ3QibalV9UibSziarcmJbScpSOEsmfelFg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名网站</span></strong><span>：华东师范大学研究生报考服务系统（https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=4）</span></p><p><strong><span>申请截止时间</span></strong><span>：2025年7月3日</span></p><p><strong><span>申请材料：</span></strong></p><p><span>①居民身份证、夏令营诚信承诺书、《华东师范大学优秀大学生夏令营申请表》（具体要求见报名系统）；</span></p><p><span>②本科成绩单（前5学期）1份（含排名），加盖学校教务处或院系公章； </span></p><p><span>③其他材料（介绍本人的外语能力、学习业绩、专业能力倾向、工作成果、学术研究兴趣、曾参与过的科研项目、创新意识创新能力、研究生阶段的学习和研究计划、其它特长及本人认为对于申请有参考价值的内容）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><strong><span>备注</span></strong><span>：③其他材料合并成一份PDF文件，并在首页列出材料清单目录。申请材料在系统中上传，不需邮寄纸质材料。申请者必须保证所提交申请材料的真实性和准确性。若在任何阶段发现申请材料不真实、不准确，或有弄虚作假、违纪作弊等行为的，即取消申请人一切资格，并保留追溯的权利。</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVxS9ia1BqSG2avnDtQeiaBU7vlQ3QibalV9UibSziarcmJbScpSOEsmfelFg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>营员遴选</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVxS9ia1BqSG2avnDtQeiaBU7vlQ3QibalV9UibSziarcmJbScpSOEsmfelFg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>我系将根据申请情况进行审查、筛选，</span><strong><span>7月5日前</span></strong><strong><span>公布入选结果</span></strong><span>，并邮件通知本人。请申请人及时关注并于</span><strong><span>7月7日中午12:00前</span></strong><strong><span>在系统中确认</span></strong><span>，逾期视为放弃资格。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVxS9ia1BqSG2avnDtQeiaBU7vlQ3QibalV9UibSziarcmJbScpSOEsmfelFg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVxS9ia1BqSG2avnDtQeiaBU7vlQ3QibalV9UibSziarcmJbScpSOEsmfelFg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>1、营员入选后须全程参与夏令营的各项活动。</span></p><p><span>2、本次夏令营期间不选拔优秀营员。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVxS9ia1BqSG2avnDtQeiaBU7vlQ3QibalV9UibSziarcmJbScpSOEsmfelFg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MA0YYF4temN6dxlUM6RT3cQMf3bNA1JVxS9ia1BqSG2avnDtQeiaBU7vlQ3QibalV9UibSziarcmJbScpSOEsmfelFg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系人</span></strong><span>：蒋老师</span></p><p><strong><span>电话</span></strong><span>：021-34756351</span></p><p><